    <criterion testable="true">POST /api/insights/ask (finding #17): (a) a subject id that is not a GUID gets 400; (b) a caller without Read on sprk_matters(subject id) and a non-existent matter get the identical uniform 404, and neither `IInsightsAi.AnswerQuestionAsync` nor the playbook execution cache is reached; (c) a raw playbook GUID whose binding is absent, disabled or of another consumer type gets the same 400 as an unregistered canonical name, and a raw GUID bound as insights-ask is accepted; (d) a parameters key ending in "id" (matterId with a value other than the subject id, tenantId, documentId) gets 400 with reasonCode `insights.parameters.not_accepted`, while matterId equal to the subject id and non-identifier keys (lookBackYears, currency, matterType) reach `IInsightsAi` unchanged; (e) a reader sending the live shape `{ question: "matter-health-single", subject: "matter:{id}", parameters: {} }` gets today's 200.</criterion>
