    <criterion testable="true">POST /api/insights/search (finding #41): for each of matter, project and invoice subjects, a caller without Read on the subject and a non-existent subject get the identical uniform 404 and `IInsightsAi.SearchAsync` is not invoked; a reader gets today's 200.</criterion>
    <criterion testable="true">POST /api/workspace/ai/summary (finding #46): for each of sprk_event, sprk_matter, sprk_project and sprk_document, a caller without Read and a non-existent id get the identical uniform 404 and `WorkspaceAiService` makes no Dataverse read (asserted on IGenericEntityService / IDocumentDataverseService); a KeyNotFoundException after the check returns the same 404 with no entityType or entityId in the body; the rights query names sprk_events / sprk_matters / sprk_projects / sprk_documents respectively (asserted on the entity-set argument); an unsupported entityType gets today's 400 and no rights query; a reader gets today's 200.</criterion>
