    <criterion testable="true">Uniformity: on every route above that answers the uniform 404, the responses for a non-existent id and for an unreadable id are byte-identical apart from correlation/trace ids, and neither contains the requested id.</criterion>
    <criterion testable="true">Filter reach: for each of the 17 routes, a test through the REAL `Map*Endpoints` host shows that a caller the seam reports as None (or, on the ten operator routes, a caller without SystemAdmin) is denied on that route. A test that calls a filter class directly does not satisfy this criterion.</criterion>
